<h3 id="featured-page">Featured Page Button</h3>
<p>
	To edit the "Request a quote" button you have to go to <kbd><kbd><samp>wp-admin</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Appearance</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Customize</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Theme Options</samp></kbd>&nbsp;→ <kbd><samp>Navigation</samp></kbd></kbd> and you will see the <b>Featured Page</b> option that you can configure to your liking. You can select any published page or define your own custom link and text for the button.
</p>
<img class="aligncenter" src="images/featured_page_button.png" alt="Featured page button">